{"product_id":"yuoto-xxl","title":"Yuoto XXL Vape (2500 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003eYuoto Disposable device is made of high-quality metal materials, lightweight and portable, and durable. All Yuoto XXL \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/disposable-vapes\" title=\"Disposable vapes\"\u003edisposable vapes\u003c\/a\u003e devices require no maintenance, charging, or refilling; once it has been used, just throw away. Yuoto XXL Disposable device is designed with master craft precision and the devices also offer large e-juice capacity with high-quality salt nicotine combined with delectable flavors in every disposable. As for the pods, the capacity is 7ml, which can meet your daily use. Choose from a wide variety of delicious e-juice flavors that include favorites for many.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMain Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e1. Lightweight and portable\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e2. The battery pack has more than 50% higher durability than similar products, reaching an amazing 2500 puffs.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e3. No button, automatic smoking\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e4. Natural plant and fruit extracts reduce taste\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e5. More protection system(Low voltage cut off mode, Short circuit protection, Overheat protection, Over time vaping protection), all designed in the chips.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecifications:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSalt Nicotine: 5%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 1200mah\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-liquid Capacity: 5.0ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePuffs: ˜2500 puffs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Yuoto","offers":[{"title":"Energy Drink Ice","offer_id":41712871931959,"sku":"Y XXL V (2.5K P) - Energy Drink Ice","price":700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Passion Fruit","offer_id":41712871964727,"sku":"Y XXL V (2